    {
      "id": "text_45",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 776,
      "y": 505,
      "width": 288,
      "height": 243.75,
      "text": "claude CLI, streamed over SSE.\nReads the whiteboard graph and\nthe context bundle, and reasons\nabout what you drew vs. what\nyou claimed.\n\nRuns a 7-phase interview —\nrequirements, entities, API,\nestimates, design, deep dive,\nbottlenecks — with a curveball\nand Socratic follow-ups.\nLeast-privilege: read-only on\nyour solutions and history.",
      "originalText": "claude CLI, streamed over SSE.\nReads the whiteboard graph and\nthe context bundle, and reasons\nabout what you drew vs. what\nyou claimed.\n\nRuns a 7-phase interview —\nrequirements, entities, API,\nestimates, design, deep dive,\nbottlenecks — with a curveball\nand Socratic follow-ups.\nLeast-privilege: read-only on\nyour solutions and history.",
      "fontSize": 15,
